  "question": {
    "text": "A passenger sitting in a train A moving at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> observes another train B moving in the opposite direction for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>. If the velocity of the train B is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>54</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then length of train B is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>320</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the velocity of A be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and the velocity of B be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math>.</p><p>The relative velocity is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Time</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>length</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>length</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>320</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
